WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:05.450
On Windows 11 + WSL 2, run oscar.bat host-check and prepare-host for 24/7 power/WSL tuning, and attach outbound TLS 443 via oscar-remote-access.ps1.

2
00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:11.082
Size Windows 11 WSL 2 nodes to 1–8 lanes (such as 6 lanes at 100% OCR) to avoid Hyper-V TCP sample bunching; use Ubuntu 24.04 bare-metal for 25–50 OCR lanes.

3
00:00:11.122 --> 00:00:16.908
Sync the right-sized config.csv in SensorHub Admin, verify smooth 5 Hz plots in Live Lane View, and federate field and HQ nodes via oscar_fed_* tokens.
